ot supported by SQLite3` — one of them mine), which are uncommitted and needed regardless of what you decide here.\n\nApprove the delete and I'll finish it; or say the word and I'll restore from the dump instead and leave the destination exactly as it was.", "permission_mode" => "auto", "prompt_id" => "04dfcd18-37ee-406e-900e-96ce21f8549a", "session_crons" => [], "session_id" => "80dcd471-007d-4438-8f86-f511c41e6e37", "stop_hook_active" => false, "transcript_path" => "/Users/johndavenport/.claude/projects/-Users-johndavenport-Documents-github-code-my-spec--claude-worktrees-phx-new-generator/80dcd471-007d-4438-8f86-f511c41e6e37.jsonl"}
