[debug] Processing with CmsHarness.Web.HooksController.handle/2
  Parameters: %{"background_tasks" => [], "cwd" => "/Users/johndavenport/Documents/github/code_my_spec/.claude/worktrees/intake-on-home", "effort" => %{"level" => "xhigh"}, "harness_id" => "d1c8f8f5-13e5-4827-865e-55a081f988a6", "hook_event_name" => "Stop", "last_assistant_message" => "That answers it, and the answer is more interesting than a straight yes.\n\n**You're right in principle, but removing it today would break the release.** Neither alias builds the local profile:\n\n```elixir\n\"assets.build\":  [\"tailwind code_my_spec\", \"esbuild code_my_spec\"]\n\"assets.deploy\": [\"tailwind code_my_spec --minify\", \"esbuild code_my_spec --minify\", \"phx.digest\"]\n```\n\nBoth name `code_my_spec` only. `code_my_spec_local` is never built by any standard task — so the checked-in `local_app.js` isn't redundant, it's the *only* copy that exists in a release. That's why it's tracked while the cloud bundle is gitignored: not a decision, an omission being papered over.\n\nAnd it has a real cost, which you just watched: rebasing my one-line source change conflicted on 3,528 lines of minified output, and the only sane resolution was to regenerate it.\n\n**The proper fix is two steps in that order:**\n\n1. Add `esbuild code_my_spec_local` to `assets.build`, and `esbuild code_my_spec_local --minify` to `assets.deploy`.\n2. Then gitignore `/priv/static/local/assets/js/local_app.js` and untrack it.\n\nDo them in that order or the CLI release ships without its JS.\n\nI'd want to confirm one thing before touching it: whether your Burrito release path actually runs `assets.deploy`, or packages `priv/static` as-is. If it's the latter, step 1 has to hook in wherever that packaging happens instead. You know that path better than I'd infer it.\n\nWant me to make that change now, or land the SigmaGraph fix first and treat the build-alias cleanup as its own commit? I'd lean toward separate — the hook fix is verified and ready to push, and the alias change deserves its own verification against a real release build.", "permission_mode" => "auto", "prompt_id" => "a5f861fc-8989-48ed-8aeb-001fcc86a060", "session_crons" => [], "session_id" => "9703aaca-90cf-4469-8202-6146afe86064", "stop_hook_active" => false, "transcript_path" => "/Users/johndavenport/.claude/projects/-Users-johndavenport-Documents-github-code-my-spec/9703aaca-90cf-4469-8202-6146afe86064.jsonl"}
