r_dev` is what releases a\n78:      \"ready_for_dev\" => story.ready_for_dev,\n85:      \"epic_local_id\" => story.epic_id,\n235:          |> put_ref(:epic_id, epics[story[\"epic_local_id\"]])\n462:  @wire_only ~w(local_id story_local_id rule_local_id epic_local_id persona_local_id)"}, "tool_use_id" => "toolu_01QBA1LJPtnZhR3hWWF8bS5F", "transcript_path" => "/Users/johndavenport/.claude/projects/-Users-johndavenport-Documents-github-code-my-spec--claude-worktrees-phx-new-generator/80dcd471-007d-4438-8f86-f511c41e6e37.jsonl"}
