[debug] Processing with CmsHarness.Web.HooksController.handle/2
  Parameters: %{"cwd" => "/Users/johndavenport/Documents/github/code_my_spec/.claude/worktrees/phx-new-generator", "effort" => %{"level" => "xhigh"}, "harness_id" => "6bc4851f-f735-4590-bb1c-c660619b4019", "hook_event_name" => "PreToolUse", "permission_mode" => "auto", "prompt_id" => "64d53258-41a1-4203-aa28-f7fe44b5787a", "session_id" => "80dcd471-007d-4438-8f86-f511c41e6e37", "tool_input" => %{"command" => "git add -A && git commit -q -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nRecord where a criterion's spex file is, rather than deriving it\n\nThe path was computed from the criterion's id and a slug of its\ndescription — test/spex/<story_id>_<slug>/criterion_<id>_<slug>_spex.exs\n— which pinned a file on disk to two things that move.\n\nThe id moves on migration. Story ids are per-deployment sequences, so\nmigrating renumbers everything and all 86 story directories on disk then\nname stories that no longer have those ids. Every criterion requirement\nwould look for a file that exists under a different name — the whole\nsuite detached at once, silently, because a missing file reads as work\nnot done rather than as a file that moved.\n\nThe slug moves whenever somebody edits a title or a description, which is\nan ordinary thing to do. The derived path changed, the file did not, and\nthe old one was orphaned with nothing pointing at it.\n\nThe export reads the real filename off disk rather than deriving one, so\nwhat crosses is where the file actually is: 744 of 921 criteria here have\na spex file, and the rest correctly have none yet. Only the harness has a\ndisk, so on a server the scan finds nothing and each criterion keeps what\nit already recorded.\n\nspec_file_path/2 prefers the recorded path and still derives when there\nis none, which is where a file's name comes from when it is first\ncreated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JPoSfcCJqSqG8iGY9nfyfL\nEOF\n)\" && git log --oneline -1; git fetch origin -q; git merge origin/main --no-edit 2>&1|tail -1; git push origin HEAD:main 2>&1|tail -1", "description" => "Commit and push the spec_path change", "timeout" => 420000}, "tool_name" => "Bash", "tool_use_id" => "toolu_01Gp36guoqKpqffUaMBpbXvN", "transcript_path" => "/Users/johndavenport/.claude/projects/-Users-johndavenport-Documents-github-code-my-spec--claude-worktrees-phx-new-generator/80dcd471-007d-4438-8f86-f511c41e6e37.jsonl"}
